  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 104.67 “Written notice” means a hardcopy or electronic copy of a notice, which may also include information submitted on an electronic form. This term also includes the terms “notification” and “notice”.\n\nSource. #13945, eff 4-27-24 (See Revision Note #5 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 100)",
